{"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "04DC", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$f : X \\to S$", "MATH_0002": "$S' \\to S$", "MATH_0003": "$S' \\to S$", "MATH_0004": "$S' \\to S$", "MATH_0005": "$X \\times_S S' \\to S'$", "MATH_0006": "$X \\to S$", "MATH_0007": "$S' \\to S$", "MATH_0008": "$f : X \\to S$", "STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{enumerate}", "STRUCT_0002": "\\item", "STRUCT_0003": "\\item", "STRUCT_0004": "\\item", "STRUCT_0005": "\\item", "STRUCT_0006": "\\end{enumerate}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-check-closed-infinitesimally}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:bb377c31947a7c459b7ac29cb733dbcd3915fb9992a82abfac1106e5f6fdeb6a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:c2c1473003697f7c6d25e1fb276dbee59b361f7db7d80327eabf56827a622669", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> and <MATH_0002> be morphisms of schemes.\nAssume\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> <MATH_0003> is a closed immersion,\n<STRUCT_0003> <MATH_0004> is bijective on points,\n<STRUCT_0004> <MATH_0005> is a closed immersion, and\n<STRUCT_0005> <MATH_0006> is of finite type or <MATH_0007> is of finite presentation.\n<STRUCT_0006>\nThen <MATH_0008> is a closed immersion.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:7a408dabd369001217983287ad6e1172710819f8146d3ad62aaf80a61d8b123b", "unit_id": "tag:0896:statement"}
