004>).\nAssumption (3) is that <MATH_0015> is surjective. From\nAlgebra, Lemma <REF_0005>\nif <MATH_0016> is of finite type\nor Algebra, Lemma <REF_0006> if <MATH_0017> is finitely generated\nand hence nilpotent we deduce that <MATH_0018> is surjective.\nThis means that <MATH_0019> is a closed immersion, see\nLemma <REF_0007>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:a9b2557ac5e77b3396339ec15c8df928591c09aa68f1f47f9706a4528ac4d610", "unit_id": "tag:0896:proof"}
